id: merchant_dialogue
title: Aldric the Merchant
weight: 10
cooldown: 0
---

=== intro

Aldric's eyes light up as you approach his stall, hands rubbing together in anticipation.

"Ah, a customer! Come, come, see what wonders I have for sale. Quality goods at fair prices - you won't find better this side of the kingdom!"

* [Show me your wares]
  -> wares

* [I'm looking for something specific]
  -> specific

* [Any interesting news?]
  -> news

* [Just browsing]
  -> farewell

=== wares

Aldric gestures grandly at his display. "I have leather armor, forged by the finest craftsmen. A silver dagger that gleams like starlight. And fresh bread from the baker's oven this morning!"

"The armor will protect you without slowing you down. The dagger... well, let's just say it's quite effective against certain creatures."

* [Tell me about the silver dagger]
  -> silver_dagger

* [What kind of creatures?]
  -> creatures

* [Thanks, I'll think about it]
  -> farewell

=== silver_dagger

"Ah, you have a discerning eye!" Aldric picks up the dagger reverently. "Pure silver blade, perfectly balanced. Some say silver has... special properties. Against the undead, against dark magic." He leans closer. "The ruins to the north, they say, are haunted by things that fear silver."

~ set_flag "knows_silver_useful"

* [I'll take the dagger]
  -> farewell

* [Tell me more about these creatures]
  -> creatures

=== creatures

Aldric's voice drops to a whisper. "There are things in the old ruins. Things that were once men, perhaps, but no longer. The hermit knows more about them than I do, but..." He shudders. "I've heard their wails on quiet nights. Unnatural. Tormented."

"If you're planning to explore those ruins, take my advice: bring silver, bring light, and don't go alone."

~ set_flag "knows_about_undead"

* [Thank you for the warning]
  -> farewell

* [I'll be careful]
  -> farewell

=== specific

"Something specific, you say?" Aldric strokes his chin thoughtfully. "Name it, friend. If I don't have it, I can probably get it. For the right price, of course."

* [I need something to help against undead]
  -> silver_dagger

* [Information about the ruins]
  -> creatures

* [Never mind]
  -> farewell

=== news

"News? Always news in a market!" Aldric chuckles. "Travelers from the east say there's trouble brewing in the capital. But closer to home..." He lowers his voice. "The ruins have been active lately. Strange lights at night, sounds that carry on the wind."

"The hermit on the forest path has been turning more people away than usual. Whatever's happening up there, it's getting worse."

~ set_flag "knows_ruins_active"

* [Thanks for the information]
  -> farewell

=== farewell

Aldric waves cheerfully. "Come back anytime! And remember - quality goods, fair prices!"

-> END
